60,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Candidate B, the Central Study Commons, fits the high-booking and high-review criteria.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree. The data shows general rooms are in high demand and underutilized specialist rooms are not.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,George,,"I am worried about the maintenance burden, but the other options seem worse.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"A study commons is less exposed to weather than outdoor paths, so it might stay on schedule.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The cost of ventilation for labs is rising, making Candidate A riskier financially.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"Candidate C, the Path Network, is exposed to weather, which Mizuki noted causes delays.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"Candidate D, the Media Center, would likely suffer from low booking rates like other specialist rooms.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,George,,"Candidate A requires significant mechanical work, which Benjamin says is getting more expensive.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Candidate B is an indoor conversion, avoiding the weather delays seen in site diaries.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,Candidate B avoids the high-cost mechanical plant issues affecting Candidate A.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Toshio,,The post-occupancy data strongly favors a space that is widely accessible and bookable.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,The booking data confirms that general-purpose space is what the campus actually needs.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,George,,"While I have concerns about staffing, Candidate B seems the most logical choice.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,The delivery schedule data suggests indoor projects are more reliable than outdoor ones.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"From a financial perspective, Candidate B avoids the rising costs of specialized equipment.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
